      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Analyse how a rise in interest rates might affect a house-building business.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(8)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<p>Marked by level of response. Top-level answers are sustained, analytical and reach a supported judgement.</p>\n<p>Indicative content:</p>\n<ul><li>Mortgages cost more, so demand for new houses falls</li><li>The cost of the business's own borrowing rises, reducing profit margins</li><li>Possible responses: lower prices, slower building, smaller homes</li><li>Analysis develops each point into a chain of consequences for the business</li></ul>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
