      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Explain three factors a business should consider when arranging a meeting with clients who are based overseas.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(6)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<p>Two marks for each factor explained, for example:</p>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Time zones: choose a time within working hours for all participants</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Format and technology: video conferencing avoids travel cost, but needs reliable connections</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Language and culture: translated documents and awareness of business customs</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(2)</span></div>",
